[h1][b]Sudden update and discount! Happy Halloween to you![/b][/h1]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43079794/4824336313ca7bcc632c2ceac9a5bf4297f350c4.png[/img]

[b]▪ The game has been ported to the new, latest version of the engine; 
▪ Updated all technical aspects of the game: 
▪ This will allow us to keep our finger on the pulse in the future and respond more quickly to challenges.[/b]

[b]▪ Fixed a rare crash in puzzles that occurred when performing a certain sequence of actions;
▪ Fixed a bug that allowed you to pass puzzles in an unfair way, using the flaws of the pause;
▪ Fixed the mechanism for switching windowed and fullscreen mode;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]


[h3][b]■ Discounts for the whole week up to 90%! Hurry up to buy the game at a bargain price:[/b][/h3]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010320

[h3][b]We made a few changes for the sake of the players from Germany and China:[/b][/h3]
[b]• The achievement for installing the free DLC has been completely removed. Unfortunately this DLC is not available in Germany and China;
• Added a new achievement available to the whole world: View any TOP 5 players on the level selection screen;
• All other players should not worry! You don't need to get a new achievement again if you have already opened them all.[/b]

[h3][b]Other fixes:[/b][/h3]
[b]• Fixed a bug when an achievement was given on the settings screen;
• Japanese language: improved display of TOP-5 results;
• Correction of windowed / fullscreen switching modes;
• Improved gamepad support;
• Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance;
• Improved music mixing. You won't hear the silence anymore =)[/b]

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010320

[h3][b]Write about bugs and errors on the forum: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/2010320/discussions/]Forum[/url][/b][/h3]
